<title>USA: Logitech Q4 ADS $0.27 vs $0.09.</title>
<headline>Logitech Q4 ADS $0.27 vs $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> ADS			  $0.27		    $0.09</p>
<p> Net			  4,700		    1,600</p>
<p> Revs		     108,300		   92,800</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> ADS			  $n.a.		    $n.a.</p>
<p> Net			 21,100		     n.a.</p>
<p> Revs		     413,700			n.a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTES: Quarter and fiscal years end March 31.</p>
<p>The company, whose stock is publicly traded in Switzerland, began trading American Depository Shares on March 20, 1997. It did not report ADS filings for all periods.</p>
<p>The company did report dollar-denominated share earnings for some periods, which differ from ADS earnings.  Share earnings in Q4 1997 and Q4 1996 were $2.72 and $0.95, respectively. Share earnings for the full fiscal year 1997, ended March 31, were $12.40, 148 percent more than the year-earlier period.</p>
<p>Full name of company is Logitech International</p>
